        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Back Gesture Android** brings the Android-style back gesture to iOS. A blob on the screen edge follows your finger: a short swipe cancels, a long swipe goes back, and on the root screen of an app it exits to the Home Screen.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Features"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- White theme and a theme with any colour you choose\n- Auto theme: the gesture is white on dark mode and black on light mode\n- Adjustable gesture size\n- Haptics can be turned off\n- Separate **Back Gesture Android - Apps** section to disable the tweak in specific apps\n- Choose the side: left, right or both",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
